ADDENDUM (this window, after the first commits): the gate reddened on its own
  page the moment the tick advanced from 3498 to 3499, because the derivation
  round was compared as if it were a measurement. That is the stale-pair trap
  this page exists to expose, reproduced on the page itself. Fix: `round` and
  `generated_at` are labels and are ignored by --check, while every per-pair
  byte size, digest and mtime is still compared exactly; AC-PPC4 now pins the
  label case alongside the tampered-field case. Re-read after the fix:
  PPC-CHECK VERDICT PASS read_only=True, SUITE PASS 7/7.
